{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118644","id":3539978416,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7S_8iw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118644","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118644.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118644.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118644","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118644/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118644/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118644/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/fe044a6ed174126b682c067e39c1fd683a9a2f35","number":118644,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Record `tris_count` and `texture_sizes` metadata on scene import","user":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Added `texture_sizes` (in pixels) and `tris_count` in scene `.import` metadata, also bumped scene `.import` file version to **2**.\r\n\r\nAffects file type: gltf, fbx, dae, obj (as scene)\r\n\r\nExample scene `.import` file after this PR:\r\n```text\r\n[remap]\r\n\r\nimporter=\"scene\"\r\nimporter_version=2\r\ntype=\"PackedScene\"\r\nuid=\"uid://c61qknak454m3\"\r\npath=\"res://.godot/imported/Lucy.glb-90f8a353936365b09c0f7fc62f6c6e64.scn\"\r\nmetadata={\r\n\"texture_sizes\": PackedInt32Array(4194304, 4194304),\r\n\"tris_count\": 12288\r\n}\r\n\r\n...\r\n```\r\nSo we can retrieve later with `ResourceFormatImporter::get_resource_metadata()`\r\n\r\nThis is a small update that I hope can improve PR #112060 to do more checks to avoid heavy scenes when creating thumbnails. Now that PR only checks for file sizes and dependencies, which is inaccurate to represent the complexity of a scene.\r\n\r\nI am also considering to record texture resource's resolution into its `.import` metadata (This PR only records sizes of internal/embedded textures for a 3d file), but I reckon one small step at a time.\r\n\r\nWith this PR added we can estimate scene complexity more accurately by just peeking the `.tscn` and scene `.import` files. Total tris count of a scene can be calculated by then.\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.